{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-104","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与截差无理线段与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable with an apotome of a medial straight line is an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order.","book":10,"number":104,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.104","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.104/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":104,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","contentId":"euclid-10-104","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03277e9e27b1b1f16917f04c26913fa890a7975aff2a734a2cd8e3de220a2d45","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-104.statement","euclid-10-104.construction.1","euclid-10-104.proof.1","euclid-10-104.proof.2","euclid-10-104.construction.2","euclid-10-104.proof.3","euclid-10-104.proof.4","euclid-10-104.proof.5","euclid-10-104.proof.6","euclid-10-104.proof.7","euclid-10-104.conclusion","euclid-10-104.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-104.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7b895e49564d2a1ab765e55f99671051705e18eb7bca5e9d62960cdefb27771","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable with an apotome of a medial straight line is an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可公度线中项无理线段线截差无理线段线中项无理线段线截差无理线段线,顺序相同。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d5af3fa6ea9d1efdbcf131201697e011e6f6908c25e4b9dad3a964685c55f11","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be an apotome of a medial straight line, and let CD be commensurable in length with AB; I say that CD is also an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为中项无理线段中的截差无理线段,让CD成为长度可公度,AB;我说,CD也是中项无理线段中的截差无理线段,AB也是同样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80b59cfb542674930946db65fbe0dfd94ad49fde59284425c74f4f8eaa45501c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is an apotome of a medial straight line, let EB be the annex to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于AB是中项无理线段中截差无理线段分之一,所以EB分是附件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc9173ca7289f45180a7bd2c8506527928e7f3c1abffd982a84794d31274e2b0","citations":["euclid-10-74"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AE, EB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE,EB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56c9ee90d8db7e58f52146a70b6138b94adc0159818c6220f1b89e4ffe6f54c6","citations":["euclid-6-12","euclid-5-12","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as AB is to CD, so is BE to DF; [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] therefore AE is also commensurable with CF, and BE with DF. [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设AB对CD的比等于BE对DF的比;因此,AE也是可公度对CF,BE对DF；AB 与 CD 之比等于 BE 与 DF 之比。  [ [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] [V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fe71b03e0e42a5e9b9cb0556e21e650c1899f6127e8e01cb636039c53606b07","citations":["euclid-10-23","euclid-10-13","euclid-10-74"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE, EB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF, FD are also medial straight lines [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)] commensurable in square only; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore CD is an apotome of a medial straight line. [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE,EB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF,FD也是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CD是中项无理线段,中项无理线段中的截差无理线段。 [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3096b37857cfaeec72c741b9af46403e3ffc230cf893c0b9f8b131a8710d017c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,AB也是一样的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2ac3f59c7b4e2d0d37b1c2d8de8cfc5fd427eeaa7242d40e25652b9a30ed916","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD, therefore also, as the square on AE is to the rectangle AE, EB, so is the square on CF to the rectangle CF, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比,AE对正方形对矩形对EB,EB对对矩形对CF对；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e99c88c8e52ba6019a09a8fcc4ace54072ef2dbfcb3c131c19afedefb8cf74e","citations":["euclid-5-16","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AE is commensurable with the square on CF; therefore the rectangle AE, EB is also commensurable with the rectangle CF, FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE正方形可公度CF正方形可公度,矩形AEEB可公度可公度可公度CFFD矩形FD可公度 [ [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bbfb36a0dc9d24cdcb3816a25d6bfdfb6b99047c5034f4111a4433b48f4cded","citations":["euclid-10-def-4","euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if the rectangle AE, EB is rational, the rectangle CF, FD will also be rational, [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)] and if the rectangle AE, EB is medial, the rectangle CF, FD is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果矩形 AE,EB是有理,矩形 CF,FD也将是有理,如果矩形 AE,EB是中项无理线段,矩形 CF,FD也是中项无理线段。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)] [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ceb65416eada97ef8d755c52eb337dac7c20ea48a07412d382b44fbf899d8b12","citations":["euclid-10-74"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is an apotome of a medial straight line and the same in order with AB. [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD是中项无理线段的截差无理线段,按AB、Q、D和AB顺序排列。 [[X. 74, 75](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-104.source","contentId":"euclid-10-104","revisionId":"euclid-10-104@raw-03277e9e27b1b1f1","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7883519612b1565414be92d965909491dad830d01bf1a5144c57b10191d6a